## Residual (must stay on the record)

LLVM typecheck of hello after a cold or stale `g_` listing may print
`ERRcheckempty`. Stamp-walk of a valid `g_` listing is what this slice claims.
C emit + gcc remains the product path. Full gcc-parity is residual.
OPEN-68 is not closed.

## Verdict

PASS. Named ELF stamp-walks hello twice after a planted listing, refuses `^OK`
on changed hello, and did not malloc/intern-abort on those walks.
Do not claim gcc retired. Do not close OPEN-68.
